@phdthesis{Yooa.2009,
 abstract = {This study investigated the factors influencing trust in travel-related CGM and, in turn, the

degree to which trust affects the benefits and impacts of using CGM in the course of planning

pleasure trips. An online survey of US Internet users was conducted with a total of 1170

individuals responding to questions regarding their perceptions and use of CGM for travel

planning. The findings show that CGM use is widespread and that trust depends on the type of

Website on which the CGM is posted and perceptions of other CGM creators. Also, those who

have greater trust in CGM report greater impacts and derive greater benefits from their CGM

